# Task Completion Checklist

After finishing any code change, run through these in order:

## 1. TypeScript
```bash
npx tsc --noEmit
```
Fix all type errors before finishing. Do not leave `any` casts as a shortcut.

## 2. Prisma (only if schema.prisma was changed)
```bash
npx prisma migrate dev --name <short-description>
```
`migrate dev` generates the client automatically. Never use `db push` — it bypasses migration history.
Schema changes and their migration files must always be committed together.

## 3. Build check (for larger changes)
```bash
npm run build
```
Run if you touched layout files, added new pages, or changed shared components.

## 4. Code quality
- No unused imports left behind
- No `console.log` debug statements
- No `TODO` / placeholder comments unless the user explicitly asked for them
- `'use client'` only on components that actually use browser APIs or hooks

## 5. Report back
When done, tell the user:
- Which files were created or modified
- Whether migration was run and what it was named
- Any warnings from tsc/build that need attention
